  "bodyHtml": "<p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5715958/ef68bf256cb45021c57eba8d448f992659e0435633b506711ae214f6782ca3a0.png\" data-fileno=\"4416124\" alt=\"a15714ab041eb360be3335625683746f0253452fd6a4ec89d63c63f19c10cd6e57c0214043b75dc859019bf03453b7\"></p><p><br></p><p>1-1. 말차 이격</p><p>2%한정, 3버 철갑 소총</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5715958/a869aa40577101283444f32dc01240362f5ed340b4ab010bc3211ae7f7fa0833.png\" data-fileno=\"4416125\" alt=\"a15714ab041eb360be3335625683746f0253452fd6a4ec89d63c63f39812cd6e421d2ae94ffcc585c9b35e75f9474a\"></p><p><br></p><p>1-2. 수렐루 이격</p><p>1% 한정, 철갑 머신건 (크라운 외 유일무이 철갑MG)</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5715958/32cdf939ae73174f3613ac2ba654ecc9dfcb6140357dc49338f55492b3ba7d07.png\" data-fileno=\"4416126\" alt=\"a15714ab041eb360be3335625683746f0253452fd6a4ec89d63c63f6981ccd6e1fec9bf2da8a9e21c39e20570d13c9\"></p><p><br></p><p>2-1. 세이렌 9만스킨</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5715958/4b8a91f05b3693f6352c194aa1af7ce469a22f52f78c832cc072f1954b5856df.png\" data-fileno=\"4416127\" alt=\"a15714ab041eb360be3335625683746f0253452fd6a4ec89d63c60f49d14cd6ef854368772c4b1f875b20ed0786533\"></p><p><br></p><p>2-2. 티아 스킨 3만원</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5715958/4e23296a8c0ec1bce63cf29fa403fd01e2a7c86ef6fc201608b50b97b0be8c40.png\" data-fileno=\"4416128\" alt=\"a15714ab041eb360be3335625683746f0253452fd6a4ec89d63c60f49910cd6e46f6889ea87e2f7d6062c9ffb2c5f1\"></p><p><br></p><p>2-3. 옵뽜쌈마논 3만원</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5715958/eb86c7bf9766308723495a8049bea2d4fbfe11b6b8886668a7334789d1ff25c6.png\" data-fileno=\"4416129\" alt=\"a15714ab041eb360be3335625683746f0253452fd6a4ec89d63c60f69f16cd6e0f32eeb859dc320b1ecf141ac8d297\"></p><p><br></p><p>3. 솔레&nbsp;</p><p>철갑우코 랜드이터 이격</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5715958/043259d52a7d3ee12e6b7ab2fb0f655021aedcba32e92e966cca4325096d7c21.png\" data-fileno=\"4416130\" alt=\"a15714ab041eb360be3335625683746f0253452fd6a4ec89d63c60f69f1ccd6eceef7ba0bab4ba188c564e347a\"></p><p><br></p><p>아마 이게 뉴 코어인듯</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5715958/a3f5dd12dbfa9a397bfb95eb945e89b5340f9686b409aa0c35f5d82c141a5c23.png\" data-fileno=\"4416131\" alt=\"a15714ab041eb360be3335625683746f0253452fd6a4ec89d63c60f99c16cd6eb023d3004bd273fee1f9834aceeb00\"></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5715958/07dd15e2e0859f913c53f50040826fdb50228bcfea48e4645878a67f58942de6.png\" data-fileno=\"4416132\" alt=\"a15714ab041eb360be3335625683746f0253452fd6a4ec89d63c60f99f1ccd6eabe8903aeaceb463d6ce1dcebd5113\"></p><p><br></p><p>기존 파츠 코어2개는 노파츠 노코어 판정</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5715958/2a91912f82047dc49d372871e716fbc196471e2cb66756ed891ebf0ef589550d.png\" data-fileno=\"4416133\" alt=\"a15714ab041eb360be3335625683746f0253452fd6a4ec89d63c60f89914cd6e93f24b1591ab4252b4f5845fea2d82\"></p><p><br></p><p>4. 미니게임 알카노이드(벽돌깨기)</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5715958/743ce72c6589de88f31e20936dbd2675940affe9715e70dbfc0f71565a7daf4c.png\" data-fileno=\"4416134\" alt=\"a15714ab041eb360be3335625683746f0253452fd6a4ec89d63c61f19911cd6e206427340fa0dcbe47b98e7455f184\"></p><p><br></p><p>5. 뮤지엄 3홀 추가</p><p>*7/23일</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5715958/5112eed57f415a5b0d08de6ce603e87ce4e92c3760d182586ef7b3b617dd6500.png\" data-fileno=\"4416135\" alt=\"a15714ab041eb360be3335625683746f0253452fd6a4ec89d63c61f09c17cd6ed7986721d36fa6d75ec3698f5c927e\"></p><p><br></p><p>6. 신규 애장</p><p>시ㅡㅡㅡ발 팬텀 플로라 싸가지가 없네</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5715958/30890acaca94e71fd6121abc3b27244b227a75301157b3b3488a9de70ffccd5e.png\" data-fileno=\"4416136\" alt=\"a15714ab041eb360be3335625683746f0253452fd6a4ec89d63c61f09e10cd6e5963611037a720c2b4ca89027b7d16\"></p><p><br></p><p>7-1. 느그 복각</p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5715958/b6df20e5894214e7652b71af1ca587d1586b060a2d1f48fae21f40b4be0467b3.png\" data-fileno=\"4416137\" alt=\"a15714ab041eb360be3335625683746f0253452fd6a4ec89d63c61f09817cd6e8defbd43d828c5db0e94aa80b66208\"></p><p><br></p><p>7-2. 느그 스킨복각</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5715958/8cbae0f3d63d64edcec91d5766b561338d81e50ef4bda6eb1691b599e0b9129d.png\" data-fileno=\"4416138\" alt=\"a15714ab041eb360be3335625683746f0253452fd6a4ec89d63c61f79810cd6e6feec9a3a0b20b7961e1e3a0970574\"></p><p><br></p><p>8. 느그콜라보 페르소나</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><img src=\"../../../assets/guide/5715958/3c111d251347161d16eb6f79577888ac1a95760be3d24a82a84800c7cf52ff4d.png\" data-fileno=\"4416185\" alt=\"a15714ab041eb360be3335625683746f0253452fd6a4ec89d63c66f09e11cd6ec92920d937662750fbcffa86976688\"></p><p><br></p><p>코드&nbsp;WAVETOYOU2026</p>",
